This repository hosts the binary releases of nvd — a macOS video
downloader. The binaries are provided for end-user download and
installation only. Source code is not included in this repository.

By downloading, installing, or using nvd, you agree to the following:

1. Personal Use
   You may install nvd on Macs you own or control. Free version is
   provided as-is; Pro license is per-user, valid on up to 3 devices.

2. License Key
   Pro features unlock requires a valid license key obtained from
   https://www.momosoft.one/nvd. Reselling, sharing, or generating
   license keys is prohibited.

3. Bundled Third-Party Components
   nvd ships with the following open-source components used as the
   download engine. Their respective licenses apply to those parts:

   - yt-dlp        (Unlicense)
